<treenode node="crypto_scalarmult;PHP:Function Name;3117689904;f18;2137;5;2165;;;;vpos;;v;;astring;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Definition&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    crypto_scalarmult(&#10;        #[SensitiveParameter]&#10;        string $secretKey,&#10;        string $publicKey&#10;    ): string&#10;&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    Calculate the shared secret between your secret key and your&#10;recipient&apos;s public key.&#10;Algorithm: X25519 (ECDH over Curve25519)&#10;&lt;b&gt;throws&lt;/b&gt;: SodiumException&#10;&lt;b&gt;throws&lt;/b&gt;: TypeError&#10;&#10;&lt;b&gt;Parameters:&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    string &lt;b&gt;$secretKey&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    string &lt;b&gt;$publicKey&lt;/b&gt;;;d14,2141;;b1,5;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;l $secretKey;;p $publicKey;;p;;x;;x;;n">
