<treenode node="crypto_secretbox;PHP:Function Name;3117689904;f18;2208;5;2230;;;;vpos;;v;;astring;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Definition&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    crypto_secretbox(&#10;        #[SensitiveParameter]&#10;        string $plaintext,&#10;        string $nonce,&#10;        #[SensitiveParameter]&#10;        string $key&#10;    ): string&#10;&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    Authenticated symmetric-key encryption.&#10;Algorithm: XSalsa20-Poly1305&#10;&lt;b&gt;throws&lt;/b&gt;: SodiumException&#10;&lt;b&gt;throws&lt;/b&gt;: TypeError&#10;&#10;&lt;b&gt;Parameters:&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    string &lt;b&gt;$plaintext&lt;/b&gt;: The message you&apos;re encrypting&#10;    string &lt;b&gt;$nonce&lt;/b&gt;: A Number to be used Once;s must be 24 bytes&#10;    string &lt;b&gt;$key&lt;/b&gt;: Symmetric encryption key&#10;&#10;&lt;b&gt;Return:&lt;/b&gt;&#10;   Ciphertext with Poly1305 MAC;;d14,2214;;b1,5;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;l $plaintext;;p $nonce;;p $key;;p;;x;;x;;x;;n">
