</treenode>
<treenode node="crypto_stream;PHP:Function Name;3117689904;f18;2820;5;2841;;;;vpos;;v;;astring;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Definition&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    crypto_stream(&#10;        int $len,&#10;        string $nonce,&#10;        #[SensitiveParameter]&#10;        string $key&#10;    ): string&#10;&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    Expand a key and nonce into a keystream of pseudorandom bytes.&#10;&lt;b&gt;throws&lt;/b&gt;: SodiumException&#10;&lt;b&gt;throws&lt;/b&gt;: TypeError&#10;&#10;&lt;b&gt;Parameters:&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    int &lt;b&gt;$len&lt;/b&gt;: Number of bytes desired&#10;    string &lt;b&gt;$nonce&lt;/b&gt;: Number to be used Once;s must be 24 bytes&#10;    string &lt;b&gt;$key&lt;/b&gt;: XSalsa20 key&#10;&#10;&lt;b&gt;Return:&lt;/b&gt;&#10;   Pseudorandom stream that can be XORed with messages to provide encryption (but not authentication;s see Poly1305 or crypto_auth() for that, which is not optional for security);;d14,2825;;b1,5;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;l $len;;p $nonce;;p $key;;p;;x;;x;;x;;n">
</treenode>
