</treenode>
<treenode node="crypto_stream_xor;PHP:Function Name;3117689904;f18;2862;5;2884;;;;vpos;;v;;astring;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Definition&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    crypto_stream_xor(&#10;        #[SensitiveParameter]&#10;        string $message,&#10;        string $nonce,&#10;        #[SensitiveParameter]&#10;        string $key&#10;    ): string&#10;&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    DANGER! UNAUTHENTICATED ENCRYPTION!&#10;Unless you are following expert advice, do not use this feature.&#10;Algorithm: XSalsa20&#10;This DOES NOT provide ciphertext integrity.&#10;&lt;b&gt;throws&lt;/b&gt;: SodiumException&#10;&lt;b&gt;throws&lt;/b&gt;: TypeError&#10;&#10;&lt;b&gt;Parameters:&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    string &lt;b&gt;$message&lt;/b&gt;: Plaintext message&#10;    string &lt;b&gt;$nonce&lt;/b&gt;: Number to be used Once;s must be 24 bytes&#10;    string &lt;b&gt;$key&lt;/b&gt;: Encryption key&#10;&#10;&lt;b&gt;Return:&lt;/b&gt;&#10;   Encrypted text which is vulnerable to chosen- ciphertext attacks unless you implement some other mitigation to the ciphertext (i.e. Encrypt then MAC);;d14,2868;;b1,5;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;l $message;;p $nonce;;p $key;;p;;x;;x;;x;;n">
