<treenode node="sourceMap;JS:JS Var Name;2117015011;f0;36;11;36;;;;vposRawSourceMap;;v;;a;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    The object representation of the source map that maps locations in the&#10;generated CSS back to locations in the Sass source code.&#10;This typically uses absolute `file:` URLs to refer to Sass files, although&#10;this can be controlled by having a custom {&#10;&lt;b&gt;link&lt;/b&gt;: Importer return &#10;&lt;b&gt;link&lt;/b&gt;&#10;ImporterResult.sourceMapUrl}.&#10;This is set if and only if {&#10;&lt;b&gt;link&lt;/b&gt;: Options.sourceMap is `true`.;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;l;;n">
