</treenode>
<treenode node="LegacyImporterThis;TS:Interface Name;1183701985;f0;10;1;21;;;;vpos;;v;;aLegacyPluginThis;;c;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Definition&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    interface LegacyImporterThis extends LegacyPluginThis&#10;&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    The value of `this` in the context of a {&#10;&lt;b&gt;link&lt;/b&gt;: LegacyImporter function.&#10;&lt;b&gt;category&lt;/b&gt;: Legacy&#10;&lt;b&gt;deprecated&lt;/b&gt;: This is only used by the legacy &#10;&lt;b&gt;link&lt;/b&gt;: render and &#10;&lt;b&gt;link&lt;/b&gt;&#10;renderSync} APIs. Use {&#10;&lt;b&gt;link&lt;/b&gt;: Importer with &#10;&lt;b&gt;link&lt;/b&gt;: compile, &#10;&lt;b&gt;link&lt;/b&gt;&#10;compileString}, {&#10;&lt;b&gt;link&lt;/b&gt;: compileAsync, and &#10;&lt;b&gt;link&lt;/b&gt;: compileStringAsync instead.;;d54,10;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;l;;n">
<treenode node="fromImport;JS:JS Var Name;1183701985;f0;20;12;20;;;;vposboolean;;v;;a;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    Whether the importer is being invoked because of a Sass `&#10;&lt;b&gt;import&lt;/b&gt;: ` rule, as&#10;opposed to a `&#10;&lt;b&gt;use&lt;/b&gt;: ` or `&#10;&lt;b&gt;forward&lt;/b&gt;: ` rule.&#10;This should *only* be used for determining whether or not to load&#10;[import-only files](https://sass-lang.com/documentation/at-rules/import#import-only-files).&#10;&lt;b&gt;compatibility&lt;/b&gt;: dart: &quot;1.33.0&quot;, node: false;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;l;;n">
</treenode>
