</treenode>
<treenode node="\r;JS:JS Var Name;397717371;f22;53;24;53;;;;vpos;;v;;a;;r;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;l;;n">
</treenode>
<treenode node="context;JS:JS Var Name;397717371;f0;16;11;16;;;;vposLegacyPluginThis;;v;;a;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    The same {&#10;&lt;b&gt;link&lt;/b&gt;: LegacyPluginThis instance that contains this object.;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;l;;n">
</treenode>
<treenode node="includePaths;JS:JS Var Name;397717371;f0;32;16;32;;;;vpos;;v;;a;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    The value passed to {&#10;&lt;b&gt;link&lt;/b&gt;: LegacySharedOptions.includePaths separated by&#10;`&quot;;s&quot;` on Windows or `&quot;:&quot;` on other operating systems. This always&#10;includes the current working directory as the first entry.;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;l;;n">
</treenode>
