<treenode node="style;JS:JS Var Name;600094962;f0;372;7;372;;;;vposOutputStyle;;v;;a;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    The {&#10;&lt;b&gt;link&lt;/b&gt;: OutputStyle of the compiled CSS.&#10;&lt;b&gt;example&lt;/b&gt;&#10;```js&#10;const source = `&#10;h1 {&#10;font-size: 40px;s&#10;code {&#10;font-face: Roboto Mono;s&#10;}&#10;}`;s&#10;let result = sass.compileString(source, {style: &quot;expanded&quot;});s&#10;console.log(result.css.toString());s&#10;// h1 {&#10;//   font-size: 40px;s&#10;// }&#10;// h1 code {&#10;//   font-face: Roboto Mono;s&#10;// }&#10;result = sass.compileString(source, {style: &quot;compressed&quot;})&#10;console.log(result.css.toString());s&#10;// h1{font-size:40px}h1 code{font-face:Roboto Mono}&#10;```&#10;&lt;b&gt;category&lt;/b&gt;: Output;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;l;;n">
