<treenode node="configurePreviewServer;JS:JS Var Name;38858981;f0;3095;26;3095;;;;vposObjectHook;;v;;a;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    Configure the preview server. The hook receives the {&#10;&lt;b&gt;link&lt;/b&gt;: PreviewServer&#10;instance. This can also be used to store a reference to the server&#10;for use in other hooks.&#10;The hooks are called before other middlewares are applied. A hook can&#10;return a post hook that will be called after other middlewares are&#10;applied. Hooks can be async functions and will be called in series.;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;l;;n">
</treenode>
<treenode node="configureServer;JS:JS Var Name;38858981;f0;3085;19;3085;;;;vposObjectHook;;v;;a;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    Configure the vite server. The hook receives the {&#10;&lt;b&gt;link&lt;/b&gt;: ViteDevServer&#10;instance. This can also be used to store a reference to the server&#10;for use in other hooks.&#10;The hooks will be called before internal middlewares are applied. A hook&#10;can return a post hook that will be called after internal middlewares&#10;are applied. Hook can be async functions and will be called in series.;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;l;;n">
</treenode>
<treenode node="enforce;JS:JS Var Name;38858981;f0;3058;11;3058;;;;vposString;;v;;a;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    Enforce plugin invocation tier similar to webpack loaders. Hooks ordering&#10;is still subject to the `order` property in the hook object.&#10;Plugin invocation order:&#10;- alias resolution&#10;- `enforce: &apos;pre&apos;` plugins&#10;- vite core plugins&#10;- normal plugins&#10;- vite build plugins&#10;- `enforce: &apos;post&apos;` plugins&#10;- vite build post plugins;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;l;;n">
