<treenode node="count;JS:Function Name;4218074545;f0;5102;9;5102;;;;vpos;;v;;anumber;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    Returns the size of this Collection.&#10;Regardless of if this Collection can describe its size lazily (some Seqs&#10;cannot), this method will always return the correct size. E.g. it&#10;evaluates a lazy `Seq` if necessary.&#10;If `predicate` is provided, then this returns the count of entries in the&#10;Collection for which the `predicate` returns true.;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;lpredicate;;pvalue;;pkey;;piter;;pboolean;;pcontext;;p(;;xV;;xK;;xthis;;x;;xoptional unknown;;x;;n">
