<treenode node="filter;JS:JS Var Name;4218074545;f0;4702;10;4702;;;;vpos;;v;;a;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    Returns a new Collection of the same type with only the entries for which&#10;the `predicate` function returns true.&#10;&lt;!-- runkit:activate --&gt;&#10;```js&#10;const { Map } = require(&apos;immutable&apos;)&#10;Map({ a: 1, b: 2, c: 3, d: 4}).filter(x =&gt; x % 2 === 0)&#10;// Map { &quot;b&quot;: 2, &quot;d&quot;: 4 }&#10;```&#10;Note: `filter()` always returns a new instance, even if it results in&#10;not filtering out any values.;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;l;;n">
</treenode>
<treenode node="first;JS:JS Var Name;4218074545;f0;4402;9;4402;;;;vpos;;v;;a;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    In case the `Collection` is not empty returns the first element of the&#10;`Collection`.&#10;In case the `Collection` is empty returns the optional default&#10;value if provided, if no default value is provided returns undefined.;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;l;;n">
</treenode>
<treenode node="flatMap;JS:JS Var Name;4218074545;f0;5011;11;5011;;;;vpos;;v;;a;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    Flat-maps the Collection, returning a Collection of the same type.&#10;Similar to `collection.map(...).flatten(true)`.;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;l;;n">
</treenode>
<treenode node="get;JS:JS Var Name;4218074545;f0;4379;7;4379;;;;vpos;;v;;a;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    Returns the value associated with the provided key, or notSetValue if&#10;the Collection does not contain this key.&#10;Note: it is possible a key may be associated with an `undefined` value,&#10;so if `notSetValue` is not provided and this method returns `undefined`,&#10;that does not guarantee the key was not found.;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;l;;n">
</treenode>
<treenode node="groupBy;JS:JS Var Name;4218074545;f0;4834;11;4834;;;;vpos;;v;;a;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    Returns a `Map` of `Collection`, grouped by the return&#10;value of the `grouper` function.&#10;Note: This is always an eager operation.&#10;&lt;!-- runkit:activate --&gt;&#10;```js&#10;const { List, Map } = require(&apos;immutable&apos;)&#10;const listOfMaps = List([&#10;Map({ v: 0 }),&#10;Map({ v: 1 }),&#10;Map({ v: 1 }),&#10;Map({ v: 0 }),&#10;Map({ v: 2 })&#10;])&#10;const groupsOfMaps = listOfMaps.groupBy(x =&gt; x.get(&apos;v&apos;))&#10;// Map {&#10;//   0: List [ Map{ &quot;v&quot;: 0 }, Map { &quot;v&quot;: 0 } ],&#10;//   1: List [ Map{ &quot;v&quot;: 1 }, Map { &quot;v&quot;: 1 } ],&#10;//   2: List [ Map{ &quot;v&quot;: 2 } ],&#10;// }&#10;```;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;l;;n">
</treenode>
