<treenode node="asMutable;JS:Function Name;4218074545;f0;599;13;599;;;;vpos;;v;;athis;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    An alternative API for withMutations()&#10;Note: Not all methods can be safely used on a mutable collection or within&#10;`withMutations`! Check the documentation for each method to see if it&#10;allows being used in `withMutations`.&#10;&lt;b&gt;see&lt;/b&gt;: `Map#asMutable`;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;l;;n">
