<treenode node="push;JS:Function Name;4218074545;f0;367;8;367;;;;vpos;;v;;aList;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    Returns a new List with the provided `values` appended, starting at this&#10;List&apos;s `size`.&#10;&lt;!-- runkit:activate&#10;{ &quot;preamble&quot;: &quot;const { List } = require(&apos;immutable&apos;);s&quot; }&#10;--&gt;&#10;```js&#10;List([ 1, 2, 3, 4 ]).push(5)&#10;// List [ 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 ]&#10;```&#10;Note: `push` can be used in `withMutations`.;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;lT;;p;;x;;n">
