<treenode node="map;JS:JS Var Name;4218074545;f0;3604;7;3604;;;;vpos;;v;;a;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    Returns a new Seq with values passed through a&#10;`mapper` function.&#10;```js&#10;const { Seq } = require(&apos;immutable&apos;)&#10;Seq([ 1, 2 ]).map(x =&gt; 10 * x)&#10;// Seq [ 10, 20 ]&#10;```&#10;Note: `map()` always returns a new instance, even if it produced the same&#10;value at every step.;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;l;;n">
