<treenode node="zipAll;JS:JS Var Name;4218074545;f0;4044;12;4044;;;;vpos;;v;;a;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    Returns a Collection &quot;zipped&quot; with the provided collections.&#10;Unlike `zip`, `zipAll` continues zipping until the longest collection is&#10;exhausted. Missing values from shorter collections are filled with `undefined`.&#10;```js&#10;const a = List([ 1, 2 ]);s&#10;const b = List([ 3, 4, 5 ]);s&#10;const c = a.zipAll(b);s // List [ [ 1, 3 ], [ 2, 4 ], [ undefined, 5 ] ]&#10;```;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;l;;n">
