</treenode>
<treenode node="Indexed;TS:NameSpace Name;4218074545;f4;3242;5;3247;;;;vpos;;v;;a;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Definition&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    namespace Indexed&#10;&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    `Seq` which represents an ordered indexed list of values.;;d22,3242;;b0,3;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;l;;n">
<treenode node="of;JS:Function Name;4218074545;f0;3246;17;3246;;;;vposT;;v;;aSeq.Indexed;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    Provides an Seq.Indexed of the values provided.;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;lT;;p;;x;;n">
</treenode>
</treenode>
<treenode node="Keyed;TS:NameSpace Name;4218074545;f4;3104;22;3104;;;;vpos;;v;;a;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Definition&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    namespace Keyed&#10;&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    `Seq` which represents key-value pairs.;;d20,3104;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;l;;n">
</treenode>
<treenode node="Set;TS:NameSpace Name;4218074545;f4;3420;5;3425;;;;vpos;;v;;a;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Definition&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    namespace Set&#10;&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    `Seq` which represents a set of values.&#10;Because `Seq` are often lazy, `Seq.Set` does not provide the same guarantee&#10;of value uniqueness as the concrete `Set`.;;d18,3420;;b0,3;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;l;;n">
<treenode node="of;JS:Function Name;4218074545;f0;3424;17;3424;;;;vposT;;v;;aSeq.Set;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    Returns a Seq.Set of the provided values;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;lT;;p;;x;;n">
