<treenode node="mapper;JS:Function Name;4218074545;f0;3168;14;3168;;;;vpos;;v;;aIterable;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    Returns a new Seq.Keyed with values passed through a&#10;`mapper` function.&#10;```js&#10;const { Seq } = require(&apos;immutable&apos;)&#10;Seq.Keyed({ a: 1, b: 2 }).map(x =&gt; 10 * x)&#10;// Seq { &quot;a&quot;: 10, &quot;b&quot;: 20 }&#10;```&#10;Note: `map()` always returns a new instance, even if it produced the&#10;same value at every step.;;d-1,-1;;b0,3;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;lvalue;;pkey;;piter;;pkey;;pvalue;;piter;;pentry;;pK;;pV;;piter;;pvalue;;pkey;;piter;;pvalue;;pkey;;piter;;pvalue;;pkey;;piter;;pvalue;;pkey;;piter;;pvalue;;pkey;;piter;;pV;;xK;;xthis;;xK;;xV;;xthis;;x[;;x;;xnumber;;xthis;;xV;;xK;;xthis;;xT;;xnumber;;xthis;;xT;;xnumber;;xthis;;xT;;xT;;xthis;;xT;;xT;;xthis;;x;;n">
