<treenode node="zipper;JS:Function Name;4218074545;f0;3398;14;3398;;;;vpos;;v;;aZ;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    Returns a Seq &quot;zipped&quot; with the provided collections by using a&#10;custom `zipper` function.&#10;```js&#10;const a = Seq([ 1, 2, 3 ]);s&#10;const b = Seq([ 4, 5, 6 ]);s&#10;const c = a.zipWith((a, b) =&gt; a + b, b);s&#10;// Seq [ 5, 7, 9 ]&#10;```;;d-1,-1;;b0,3;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;lvalue;;potherValue;;pvalue;;potherValue;;pthirdValue;;punknown;;pT;;xU;;xT;;xU;;xV...values Array;;x;;x;;n">
