<treenode node="Set;TS:NameSpace Name;4218074545;f2;1863;3;1911;;;;vpos;;v;;a;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Definition&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    namespace Set&#10;&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    A Collection of unique values with `O(log32 N)` adds and has.&#10;When iterating a Set, the entries will be (value, value) pairs. Iteration&#10;order of a Set is undefined, however is stable. Multiple iterations of the&#10;same Set will iterate in the same order.&#10;Set values, like Map keys, may be of any type. Equality is determined using&#10;`Immutable.is`, enabling Sets to uniquely include other Immutable&#10;collections, custom value types, and NaN.;;d16,1863;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;l;;n">
<treenode node="fromKeys;JS:Function Name;4218074545;f0;1878;21;1878;;;;vposT;;v;;aSet;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    `Set.fromKeys()` creates a new immutable Set containing the keys from&#10;this Collection or JavaScript Object.;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;lobj;;pkey;;p{[;;xstring] unknown;;x;;n">
</treenode>
<treenode node="intersect;JS:Function Name;4218074545;f0;1895;22;1895;;;;vposT;;v;;aSet;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    `Set.intersect()` creates a new immutable Set that is the intersection of&#10;a collection of other sets.&#10;```js&#10;const { Set } = require(&apos;immutable&apos;)&#10;const intersected = Set.intersect([&#10;Set([ &apos;a&apos;, &apos;b&apos;, &apos;c&apos; ])&#10;Set([ &apos;c&apos;, &apos;a&apos;, &apos;t&apos; ])&#10;])&#10;// Set [ &quot;a&quot;, &quot;c&quot; ]&#10;```;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;lsets;;pIterable;;pT;;pIterable;;x;;x;;x;;n">
</treenode>
<treenode node="isSet;JS:Function Name;4218074545;f0;1867;18;1867;;;;vpos;;v;;aSet;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    True if the provided value is a Set;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;lmaybeSet;;punknown;;x;;n">
</treenode>
<treenode node="of;JS:Function Name;4218074545;f0;1872;15;1872;;;;vposT;;v;;aSet;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    Creates a new Set containing `values`.;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;lT;;p;;x;;n">
