<treenode node="union;JS:Function Name;4218074545;f0;1910;18;1910;;;;vposT;;v;;aSet;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    `Set.union()` creates a new immutable Set that is the union of a&#10;collection of other sets.&#10;```js&#10;const { Set } = require(&apos;immutable&apos;)&#10;const unioned = Set.union([&#10;Set([ &apos;a&apos;, &apos;b&apos;, &apos;c&apos; ])&#10;Set([ &apos;c&apos;, &apos;a&apos;, &apos;t&apos; ])&#10;])&#10;// Set [ &quot;a&quot;, &quot;b&quot;, &quot;c&quot;, &quot;t&quot; ]&#10;```;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;lsets;;pIterable;;pT;;pIterable;;x;;x;;x;;n">
</treenode>
