<treenode node="isRecord;JS:Function Name;4218074545;f0;2767;21;2767;;;;vpos;;v;;aRecord;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    True if `maybeRecord` is an instance of a Record.;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;lmaybeRecord;;punknown;;x;;n">
</treenode>
<treenode node="isSeq;JS:Function Name;4218074545;f0;5602;16;5602;;;;vpos;;v;;ais;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    True if `maybeSeq` is a Seq.;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;lmaybeSeq;;punknown;;x;;n">
</treenode>
<treenode node="isSet;JS:Function Name;4218074545;f0;5638;16;5638;;;;vpos;;v;;aSet;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    True if `maybeSet` is a Set.&#10;Also true for OrderedSets.;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;lmaybeSet;;punknown;;x;;n">
