<treenode node="Color;JS:Class Name;2137872353;f9;407;3;526;;;;vpos;;v;;aObject_;;c;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Definition&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    class Color&#10;&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    Sass&apos;s [color type](https://sass-lang.com/documentation/values/colors).;;d21,407;;b0,5;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;lr;;pg;;pb;;pa;;pargb;;pnumber;;xnumber;;xnumber;;xoptional number;;x;;x;;n">
<treenode node="constructor;JS:Function Name;2137872353;f0;420;15;420;;;;vpos;;v;;a;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    Creates a new Sass color with the given red, green, blue, and alpha&#10;channels. The red, green, and blue channels must be integers between 0&#10;and 255 (inclusive), and alpha must be between 0 and 1 (inclusive).&#10;&lt;b&gt;example&lt;/b&gt;&#10;```js&#10;new sass.types.Color(107, 113, 127);s // #6b717f&#10;new sass.types.Color(0, 0, 0, 0);s // rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)&#10;```;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;largb;;pnumber;;x;;n">
</treenode>
<treenode node="getA;JS:Function Name;2137872353;f0;517;8;517;;;;vpos;;v;;anumber;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    Returns the alpha channel of the color as a number from 0 to 1.&#10;&lt;b&gt;example&lt;/b&gt;&#10;```js&#10;// color is `#6b717f`.&#10;color.getA();s // 1&#10;// color is `transparent`.&#10;color.getA();s // 0&#10;```;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;l;;n">
</treenode>
<treenode node="getB;JS:Function Name;2137872353;f0;494;8;494;;;;vpos;;v;;anumber;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    Returns the blue channel of the color as an integer from 0 to 255.&#10;&lt;b&gt;example&lt;/b&gt;&#10;```js&#10;// color is `#6b717f`.&#10;color.getB();s // 127&#10;// color is `#b37399`.&#10;color.getB();s // 153&#10;```;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;l;;n">
</treenode>
<treenode node="getG;JS:Function Name;2137872353;f0;471;8;471;;;;vpos;;v;;anumber;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    Returns the green channel of the color as an integer from 0 to 255.&#10;&lt;b&gt;example&lt;/b&gt;&#10;```js&#10;// color is `#6b717f`.&#10;color.getG();s // 113&#10;// color is `#b37399`.&#10;color.getG();s // 115&#10;```;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;l;;n">
</treenode>
<treenode node="getR;JS:Function Name;2137872353;f0;448;8;448;;;;vpos;;v;;anumber;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    Returns the red channel of the color as an integer from 0 to 255.&#10;&lt;b&gt;example&lt;/b&gt;&#10;```js&#10;// color is `#6b717f`.&#10;color.getR();s // 107&#10;// color is `#b37399`.&#10;color.getR();s // 179&#10;```;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;l;;n">
</treenode>
<treenode node="setA;JS:Function Name;2137872353;f0;525;8;525;;;;vpos;;v;;avoid;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    Sets the alpha channel of the color. The value must be between 0 and 1&#10;(inclusive).&#10;&lt;b&gt;deprecated&lt;/b&gt;: Use &#10;&lt;b&gt;link&lt;/b&gt;: constructor instead.;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;lvalue;;pnumber;;x;;n">
</treenode>
<treenode node="setB;JS:Function Name;2137872353;f0;502;8;502;;;;vpos;;v;;avoid;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    Sets the blue channel of the color. The value must be an integer between&#10;0 and 255 (inclusive).&#10;&lt;b&gt;deprecated&lt;/b&gt;: Use &#10;&lt;b&gt;link&lt;/b&gt;: constructor instead.;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;lvalue;;pnumber;;x;;n">
</treenode>
<treenode node="setG;JS:Function Name;2137872353;f0;479;8;479;;;;vpos;;v;;avoid;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    Sets the green channel of the color. The value must be an integer between&#10;0 and 255 (inclusive).&#10;&lt;b&gt;deprecated&lt;/b&gt;: Use &#10;&lt;b&gt;link&lt;/b&gt;: constructor instead.;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;lvalue;;pnumber;;x;;n">
</treenode>
<treenode node="setR;JS:Function Name;2137872353;f0;456;8;456;;;;vpos;;v;;avoid;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    Sets the red channel of the color. The value must be an integer between 0&#10;and 255 (inclusive).&#10;&lt;b&gt;deprecated&lt;/b&gt;: Use &#10;&lt;b&gt;link&lt;/b&gt;: constructor instead.;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;lvalue;;pnumber;;x;;n">
