<treenode node="Error;JS:Class Name;2137872353;f9;753;3;755;;;;vpos;;v;;aObject_;;c;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Definition&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    class Error&#10;&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    An error that can be returned from a Sass function to signal that it&#10;encountered an error. This is the only way to signal an error&#10;asynchronously from a {&#10;&lt;b&gt;link&lt;/b&gt;: LegacyAsyncFunction.;;d21,753;;b0,5;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;lmessage;;pstring;;x;;n">
