<treenode node="List;JS:Class Name;2137872353;f9;535;3;630;;;;vpos;;v;;aObject_;;c;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Definition&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    class List&#10;&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    Sass&apos;s [list type](https://sass-lang.com/documentation/values/lists).&#10;**Heads up!** This list type’s methods use 0-based indexing, even though&#10;within Sass lists use 1-based indexing. These methods also don’t support&#10;using negative numbers to index backwards from the end of the list.;;d20,535;;b0,5;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;llength;;pcommaSeparator;;pnumber;;xoptional boolean;;x;;n">
<treenode node="constructor;JS:Function Name;2137872353;f0;557;15;557;;;;vpos;;v;;a;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    Creates a new Sass list.&#10;**Heads up!** The initial values of the list elements are undefined.&#10;These elements must be set using {&#10;&lt;b&gt;link&lt;/b&gt;: setValue before accessing them&#10;or passing the list back to Sass.&#10;&lt;b&gt;example&lt;/b&gt;&#10;```js&#10;const list = new sass.types.List(3);s&#10;list.setValue(0, new sass.types.Number(10, &quot;px&quot;));s&#10;list.setValue(1, new sass.types.Number(15, &quot;px&quot;));s&#10;list.setValue(2, new sass.types.Number(32, &quot;px&quot;));s&#10;list;s // 10px, 15px, 32px&#10;```&#10;&#10;&lt;b&gt;Parameters:&lt;/b&gt;&#10;     &lt;b&gt;length&lt;/b&gt;: The number of (initially undefined) elements in the list.&#10;     &lt;b&gt;commaSeparator&lt;/b&gt;: If `true`, the list is comma-separated;s otherwise, it&apos;s space-separated. Defaults to `true`.;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;llength;;pcommaSeparator;;pnumber;;xoptional boolean;;x;;n">
</treenode>
<treenode node="getLength;JS:Function Name;2137872353;f0;629;13;629;;;;vpos;;v;;anumber;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    Returns the number of elements in the list.&#10;&lt;b&gt;example&lt;/b&gt;&#10;```js&#10;// list is `10px, 15px, 32px`&#10;list.getLength();s // 3&#10;// list is `1px solid`&#10;list.getLength();s // 2&#10;```;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;l;;n">
</treenode>
<treenode node="getSeparator;JS:Function Name;2137872353;f0;607;16;607;;;;vpos;;v;;aboolean;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    Returns `true` if this list is comma-separated and `false` otherwise.&#10;&lt;b&gt;example&lt;/b&gt;&#10;```js&#10;// list is `10px, 15px, 32px`&#10;list.getSeparator();s // true&#10;// list is `1px solid`&#10;list.getSeparator();s // false&#10;```;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;l;;n">
</treenode>
<treenode node="getValue;JS:Function Name;2137872353;f0;575;12;575;;;;vpos;;v;;aLegacyValue;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    Returns the element at `index`, or `undefined` if that value hasn&apos;t yet&#10;been set.&#10;&lt;b&gt;example&lt;/b&gt;&#10;```js&#10;// list is `10px, 15px, 32px`&#10;list.getValue(0);s // 10px&#10;list.getValue(2);s // 32px&#10;```&#10;&lt;b&gt;throws&lt;/b&gt;: `Error` if `index` is less than 0 or greater than or equal to the&#10;number of elements in this list.&#10;&#10;&lt;b&gt;Parameters:&lt;/b&gt;&#10;     &lt;b&gt;index&lt;/b&gt;: A (0-based) index into this list.;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;l;;n">
</treenode>
<treenode node="setSeparator;JS:Function Name;2137872353;f0;614;16;614;;;;vpos;;v;;avoid;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    Sets whether the list is comma-separated.&#10;&#10;&lt;b&gt;Parameters:&lt;/b&gt;&#10;     &lt;b&gt;isComma&lt;/b&gt;: `true` to make the list comma-separated, `false` otherwise.;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;lisComma;;pboolean;;x;;n">
</treenode>
<treenode node="setValue;JS:Function Name;2137872353;f0;592;12;592;;;;vpos;;v;;avoid;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    Sets the element at `index` to `value`.&#10;&lt;b&gt;example&lt;/b&gt;&#10;```js&#10;// list is `10px, 15px, 32px`&#10;list.setValue(1, new sass.types.Number(18, &quot;px&quot;));s&#10;list;s // 10px, 18px, 32px&#10;```&#10;&lt;b&gt;throws&lt;/b&gt;: `Error` if `index` is less than 0 or greater than or equal to the&#10;number of elements in this list.&#10;&#10;&lt;b&gt;Parameters:&lt;/b&gt;&#10;     &lt;b&gt;index&lt;/b&gt;: A (0-based) index into this list.;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;lvalue;;pLegacyValue;;x;;n">
</treenode>
