<treenode node="Map;JS:Class Name;2137872353;f9;641;3;746;;;;vpos;;v;;aObject_;;c;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Definition&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    class Map&#10;&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    Sass&apos;s [map type](https://sass-lang.com/documentation/values/maps).&#10;**Heads up!** This map type is represented as a list of key-value pairs&#10;rather than a mapping from keys to values. The only way to find the value&#10;associated with a given key is to iterate through the map checking for that&#10;key. Maps created through this API are still forbidden from having duplicate&#10;keys.;;d19,641;;b0,5;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;llength;;pnumber;;x;;n">
<treenode node="constructor;JS:Function Name;2137872353;f0;662;15;662;;;;vpos;;v;;a;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    Creates a new Sass map.&#10;**Heads up!** The initial keys and values of the map are undefined. They&#10;must be set using {&#10;&lt;b&gt;link&lt;/b&gt;: setKey and &#10;&lt;b&gt;link&lt;/b&gt;: setValue before accessing&#10;them or passing the map back to Sass.&#10;&lt;b&gt;example&lt;/b&gt;&#10;```js&#10;const map = new sass.types.Map(2);s&#10;map.setKey(0, new sass.types.String(&quot;width&quot;));s&#10;map.setValue(0, new sass.types.Number(300, &quot;px&quot;));s&#10;map.setKey(1, new sass.types.String(&quot;height&quot;));s&#10;map.setValue(1, new sass.types.Number(100, &quot;px&quot;));s&#10;map;s // (width: 300px, height: 100px)&#10;```&#10;&#10;&lt;b&gt;Parameters:&lt;/b&gt;&#10;     &lt;b&gt;length&lt;/b&gt;: The number of (initially undefined) key/value pairs in the map.;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;llength;;pnumber;;x;;n">
</treenode>
<treenode node="getKey;JS:Function Name;2137872353;f0;713;10;713;;;;vpos;;v;;aLegacyValue;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    Returns the key in the key/value pair at `index`.&#10;&lt;b&gt;example&lt;/b&gt;&#10;```js&#10;// map is `(width: 300px, height: 100px)`&#10;map.getKey(0);s // width&#10;map.getKey(1);s // height&#10;```&#10;&lt;b&gt;throws&lt;/b&gt;: `Error` if `index` is less than 0 or greater than or equal to the&#10;number of pairs in this map.&#10;&#10;&lt;b&gt;Parameters:&lt;/b&gt;&#10;     &lt;b&gt;index&lt;/b&gt;: A (0-based) index of a key/value pair in this map.;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;l;;n">
</treenode>
<treenode node="getLength;JS:Function Name;2137872353;f0;745;13;745;;;;vpos;;v;;anumber;;r&#10;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&#10;    Returns the number of key/value pairs in this map.&#10;&lt;b&gt;example&lt;/b&gt;&#10;```js&#10;// map is `(&quot;light&quot;: 200, &quot;medium&quot;: 400, &quot;bold&quot;: 600)`&#10;map.getLength();s // 3&#10;// map is `(width: 300px, height: 100px)`&#10;map.getLength();s // 2&#10;```;;d-1,-1;;b0,0;;m0;;e0;;i0;;o;;k;;l;;n">
